    "review": "Do not adopt this modern chip build workaround or update historical goldens. The source comments out one active last-focused-chip destruction regression with a TODO, reducing 67 cases to66; the remaining66 callbacks are identical. Its API golden adds protected modern MatChipGrid/MatChipSet focus-redirection declarations without a runtime implementation change in this SHA. The owned legacy chip list retains its active empty-list/repopulation regression and all historical callbacks; no modern chip class or protected API mirror is introduced. Preserve actual focus/reset/lifetime execution obligations and untouched Material16 reference goldens."
  },
  "decision": "Do not adopt this modern chip build workaround or update historical goldens. The source comments out one active last-focused-chip destruction regression with a TODO, reducing 67 cases to66; the remaining66 callbacks are identical. Its API golden adds protected modern MatChipGrid/MatChipSet focus-redirection declarations without a runtime implementation change in this SHA. The owned legacy chip list retains its active empty-list/repopulation regression and all historical callbacks; no modern chip class or protected API mirror is introduced. Preserve actual focus/reset/lifetime execution obligations and untouched Material16 reference goldens. Exact compiler/Node/RxJS/peer floors, consumer/SSR/browser gates, private command-source reconciliation and independent audit remain separate. No publication.",
